summary:
  The single file's horizon watchdog runs over a list too.

history:
  On a list the position stops at the length the list had when it was
  opened while the sound goes on: that is how the player reports a list that
  grows. The watchdog takes three seconds of a standing position for the
  single file's frozen horizon and reopens, every three seconds.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          if (!shifted || slide || playing !== true) {

replace:
          if (!shifted || playing !== true) {

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slideengine.qml::test_a_list_has_no_horizon_to_watch.
